  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aawaz II: Inclusion, Accountability and Preventing Modern Slavery - MEL (I-FORM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO has contracted Oxford Policy Management for the Independent Feedback, Operational Review and Monitoring (I-FORM) of Aawaz II. The purpose of this assignment is to execute independent operational reviews and assessments of programmatic interventions, to collect beneficiary feedback, and to provide coordination and documentation support to the programme through critical channels including the Quarterly Technical Reviews (QTR) mechanism and a dedicated dashboard for tracking progress against the milestones articulated in programmatic workplans.</narrative>
  </description>
